  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together muscovado sugar, olive oil, garlic, parsley, feta cheese, olives, artichoke hearts, salt, black pepper, Greek seasoning, and dried oregano.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a 9x13-inch baking dish and crumble the crusty bread on top.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until the bread is golden brown and the flavors are fully absorbed."
